# Open and novel image issues for TNN diagnosis.
# Format: id|name|anomalies(sym:severity,...)|question
# I1-I3 are the open issues from Micah's order. N1-N4 are novel (held-out);
# N1-N3 exemplify learned patterns under new surface details, N4 matches none.
I1|UPSCALE-GEN-PATH|23:9,24:9,25:7|How does the upscale line get from drawing operators to true generation? No pixel is synthesized from world-knowledge; every output byte is a deterministic function of observed bytes; the outpaint repeats the edge column mean+atom for 11776 strip pixels.
I2|OPERATOR-DRAWING|6:8,8:7,9:6,10:5,7:4|The upscale render path draws with Bresenham chords (tl_chord_paint), bicubic (bicubic2x), and a 50/50 nearest/bilinear blend, while the SHAPES vocabulary itself is measured. What is wrong and what is the fix direction?
I3|HARDCODED-CLASS|11:8,12:9,13:9|head-x=160 was one hardcoded constant where a measured value should be (error 22px persisted after teaching; 22 equals |160-182|). What is the class of bug and how should TNN hunt for other instances?
N1|OUTPAINT-SEAM|14:7,15:8,16:8,25:6|The outpaint strip shows a visible vertical edge at the frame boundary; the strip was built by repeating the edge column. Measured seam step at the boundary is 3.1x the true texture step. What is wrong?
N2|EAR-SCALE|11:8,12:9,13:7|Ears are placed with a fixed 0.8 scale factor applied to side-view ear measurements; the 0.8 appears as a literal in code; the placement error stays 35px after teaching frontal ears, and 35 is close to the factor-induced offset. What is wrong?
N3|JAGGED-LINES|6:7,8:8,18:5|LINES segments look jagged at 2x magnification; the renderer rasterizes with Bresenham; the vocabulary holds no thin-line atoms. What is wrong?
N4|LABEL-SPECKLES|26:6|The label map shows isolated single pixels labeled CONSTRUCTED-SHAPES inside smooth sky regions. What is wrong?
C1|COMPOUND-UPSCALE|6:7,8:6,14:7,15:8,16:7|The 2x upscale shows both jagged LINES from Bresenham rasterization AND visible rectangular seams where textured SHAPES blocks meet smooth NO-FIT regions (seam 2.6x true step). What is wrong?
